<title>CHINA: China '96 aluminium output seen at 1.74 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>China '96 aluminium output seen at 1.74 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China expects to produce 1.74 million tonnes of aluminium in 1996, the China Daily said on Tuesday, quoting the China National Nonferrous Metals Industry Corp.</p>
<p>China produced a total of 1.5466 million tonnes of aluminium in the first 11 months of 1996, up 2.34 percent from the same period last year.</p>
